---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — AI Agent Worx">
	<section>
		<h1>About</h1>
		<p class="lede">
			AI Agent Worx is the home for our work building practical AI agent systems — for ourselves and for the businesses we partner with.
		</p>

		<h2>Our approach</h2>
		<p>
			We've been around long enough to know that the real wins come from doing the boring work well: knowing the customer, understanding the workflow, and building tools that fit. AI is a powerful new tool — but it's still just a tool.
		</p>
		<p>
			We focus on agents that solve actual problems, integrate cleanly with existing systems, and earn their keep. No vaporware. No demos that fall apart in production.
		</p>

		<h2>What we believe</h2>
		<p>
			<strong>Agents should ship.</strong> If it doesn't make it to production and survive contact with reality, it doesn't count.
		</p>
		<p>
			<strong>Simple beats clever.</strong> The best agent is the one your team actually uses, day after day.
		</p>
		<p>
			<strong>Observable or it's broken.</strong> If you can't see what an agent is doing, you can't trust it.
		</p>
	</section>
</Layout>
